# Every value here is optional for `task test`, `task table`, and `task checks`.
# A paper with planned diagrams additionally needs `task setup` and one image
# backend accepted by imagen-diagrams; otherwise it exits 2 with a prompt file.
#
# Place a key in this folder's `.env`, or in `../.env`, `../../.env`, or
# `../../../.env`. The closest non-empty value wins; an exported shell value
# wins over every file. Copy this file to any one of those locations.

# --- The model that drives the loop. Needed by `task live`. ---
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# --- Research. Without it, the live runner selects its web-search fallback. ---
# The MCP server in ../../.mcp.json reads this same name.
PERPLEXITY_API_KEY=

# --- One possible imagen-diagrams backend. The plugin owns backend selection;
# --- there is deliberately no SVG or plain-PNG publication fallback.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# Imagen 0.6 also accepts this native name. If it is absent, the adapter maps
# GEMINI_API_KEY into the renderer child process without printing it.
GOOGLE_API_KEY=

# --- Optional image-gen v2.1 backend for cover and non-diagram art.
XAI_API_KEY=

# --- Prior research. Defaults to ../../../loop_eng_2nd_brain/knowledge.
# --- Absent is fine. The planner says so and continues.
SECOND_BRAIN=

# --- Perplexity model, if you want something other than sonar-pro.
PERPLEXITY_MODEL=
